   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "When male lion cubs reach sexual maturity, they are thrown out of their group, or pride, by the dominant male and must live on their own or with other males until they can take over their own pride. This can alter the allele frequencies of the population through which of the following mechanisms?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1012274,
     "content_html": "natural selection"
    },
    {
     "id": 1012275,
     "content_html": "gene flow"
    },
    {
     "id": 1012276,
     "content_html": "random mating"
    },
    {
     "id": 1012277,
     "content_html": "genetic drift"
